renaissance-cyber: a parallax set for the Neo launcher, the wallpaper of the optional Renaissance look ("Cyberpunk
meets Italian Renaissance"). Original procedural art, drawn by tools/parallax-renaissance/build_renaissance.py; no
third-party material.

Layers, back to front (depth in parallax.json):
  layer0.jpg  -0.60  the night: lapis gradient, gold dust, armillary rings, a faint cyan perspective floor
  layer1.png  -0.25  Vitruvian circle and square, golden pentagon, graduated ticks, cyan nodes and HUD arcs
  layer2.png   0.10  the arcade: round arches on a dark lapis wall, gold edge, cyan inner line
  layer3.png   0.55  the owl of Minerva framed by laurel
  layer4.png   1.00  glitch bars, HUD corner brackets, soft gold motes
wallpaper.jpg is the set flattened at rest (1080x2400); preview.jpg is 512x512.
